  "_comment_add": "\"+\": components ADDED to a page (apply_overrides.py). An event of \"ldrc <word>\" is handled by the screen itself and never reaches the Teensy: \"ldrc update\" = Check for update, \"ldrc wifi\" = the WiFi page, \"ldrc flight\" = the flight screen's setup page, \"ldrc colours\" = the Themes page, \"ldrc appearance\" = the Appearance page, \"ldrc defined\" = the pilot's own front screen now (the front page's \"Defined screen\").",
